  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f209389699-11105535-36c9-458b-b579-485783b853e8.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/209389699-11105535-36c9-458b-b579-485783b853e8.png\"></a><br><br>本模组会让被箭矢击中的实体在死亡时掉落这些箭矢！<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9296b230044bb4ef07851ff9baa2d04aeb210baee3467abafff1380fa081f08b/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4f6c31546366382e706e67\" alt=\"Fabric API\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arrow-entity-loot-drop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/82d0a1b5c2daf77073d6e27deee41a210ff039e9a11a94441d6c8ff01d79fe35/68747470733a2f2f63662e776179326d7563686e6f6973652e65752f66756c6c5f3730393739365f646f776e6c6f6164732e737667\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farrow-entity-loot-drop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6bddf921228c3af343acd4fcf15ec8e04b99f06be726c4bc14b9b3bbbf6c1ffc/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6d6f6472696e74682f64742f6172726f772d656e746974792d6c6f6f742d64726f703f6c6162656c3d4d6f6472696e7468253230446f776e6c6f616473\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/22e871c455cd23486b8c0d9b9f364f52c00c1fa141ebc5b58ac886a1d05d37ea/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f5065707065726f6e692d4a6162726f6e692f4172726f77456e746974794c6f6f7444726f702f746f74616c3f6c6162656c3d446f776e6c6f616473266c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop#-about\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📖&nbsp;简介</h2>\n<p>这一直是《我的世界》战斗中让我感到困扰的地方，也让“无限”附魔显得像是必需品。为什么游戏要惩罚射得准的玩家？脱靶的箭可以回收，为什么命中的不行？请注意，玩家无法拾取的箭矢（例如骷髅射出的箭、使用无限附魔射出的箭等）不会被存储或掉落——否则就太作弊了。</p>\n<p>当前的默认概率如下（详见配置文件以进行修改）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>25% 箭矢会损坏（实体死亡时不会掉落）</li>\n<li>50% 箭矢会以普通箭的形式掉落</li>\n<li>25% 箭矢的类型也会被保留（包括光灵箭或药水箭）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意：本模组不会尝试序列化实体所含的箭矢数据——因此，服务器重启将清除所有实体与箭矢的关联数据。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>⚙️&nbsp;配置</h2>\n<p>本模组高度可配置，并支持通过 ModMenu 在游戏中编辑配置。请在此查看当前配置的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop/blob/main/src/main/java/pepjebs/arrowentitylootdrop/config/ArrowEntityLootDropConfig.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">选项</a>！</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop#-changelog\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📃&nbsp;更新日志</h2>\n<p>更新日志可在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Releases 页面</a>查阅</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/ArrowEntityLootDrop#-media\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>📸&nbsp;媒体</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fuser-images.githubusercontent.com%252f17690401%252f202060344-1dfed3d7-bdf3-44c0-9fe7-bf83e3464a0a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/202060344-1dfed3d7-bdf3-44c0-9fe7-bf83e3464a0a.png\" alt=\"2022-11-15_17 24 33\"></a></p>",
